msgid "Answer from the hub while online"
msgstr "Answer from the hub while online"

msgid ""
"For these programmes, each hub answers staff from its own copy even when "
"central is reachable, so screens do not wait on a slow or unreliable link. "
"Saves still go to central at once. Changes made elsewhere (another "
"facility, a district officer) reach staff at the hub's next sync, 15 "
"minutes by default. Searches across the district still go to central, "
"unless a user's search scope is their facility alone. Hubs read this "
"setting within an hour."
msgstr ""
"For these programmes, each hub answers staff from its own copy even when "
"central is reachable, so screens do not wait on a slow or unreliable link. "
"Saves still go to central at once. Changes made elsewhere (another "
"facility, a district officer) reach staff at the hub's next sync, 15 "
"minutes by default. Searches across the district still go to central, "
"unless a user's search scope is their facility alone. Hubs read this "
"setting within an hour."

