msgstr "Programmes"

msgid "None, so everything goes to central while online"
msgstr "None, so everything goes to central while online"

msgid "Refresh metadata on all hubs"
msgstr "Refresh metadata on all hubs"

msgid ""
"Hubs that answer from their own copy while online notice most metadata "
"changes within an hour. They do not notice deletions, changes to which org "
"units a programme or data set is assigned to, or changes to settings. After "
"such a change, or to roll out a fix at once, refresh here. Every online hub "
"then fetches metadata and settings from central again within 15 minutes, "
"and an offline hub when it reconnects."
msgstr ""
"Hubs that answer from their own copy while online notice most metadata "
"changes within an hour. They do not notice deletions, changes to which org "
"units a programme or data set is assigned to, or changes to settings. After "
"such a change, or to roll out a fix at once, refresh here. Every online hub "
"then fetches metadata and settings from central again within 15 minutes, "
"and an offline hub when it reconnects."

