msgid "Reserved values"
msgstr "Reserved values"

msgid ""
"How many generated values (patient numbers, for example) each hub keeps in "
"reserve for offline registration. The hub refills the pool from central "
"when it falls below a quarter of this, in requests of at most 1000 values. "
"Without a setting here, each hub uses its own configuration's default "
"(500). Set an attribute's pool to 0 to turn its offline pool off."
msgstr ""
